# Running about on the city's roofs (BOOT_AT_HUB 1 in src/input.c; for another roof, change the
# tower it boots on there): the roofs underfoot must stay whole as you run and turn. Watch the
# debug line's "vdp1 over": a frame VDP1 doesn't finish is shown with the nearest things, the
# roof you're on, part drawn
wait_up
wait 1.5
shot cr_00
keydown up
wait 0.5
shot cr_01
keydown right
wait 0.25
shot cr_02
wait 0.25
shot cr_03
keyup right
wait 0.4
shot cr_04
keydown left
wait 0.3
shot cr_05
wait 0.3
shot cr_06
wait 0.3
shot cr_07
keyup left
wait 0.4
shot cr_08
keydown right
wait 0.3
shot cr_09
wait 0.3
shot cr_10
keyup right
wait 0.4
shot cr_11
keyup up
wait 0.3
keydown b
wait 0.8
shot cr_12_down
keyup b
hold left 0.6
keydown up
wait 0.5
shot cr_13
wait 0.5
shot cr_14
keyup up
shot cr_15
